1. This Regulation applies to nationals of a Member State, stateless individuals, and refugees who are or have been covered by the laws of one or more Member States, as well as the family members and dependents of such persons. 2. It also extends to the survivors of individuals who came under the jurisdiction of one or more Member States’ laws, regardless of their nationality, provided that such survivors are nationals of a Member State, stateless persons, or refugees residing within one of them.

